---
---

<section id="stack" class="section stack-section">
      <div class="section-label">Technical Stack</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Built to <span class="grad-text">Ship Fast.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        A battle-tested combination of modern tooling that lets us move at
        hackathon speed without sacrificing production quality.
      </p>

      <div class="stack-grid">
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-logo">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-info">
            <span class="stack-name">Astro + React</span>
            <span class="stack-desc"
              >Islands architecture — static shell, interactive components only
              where needed. Sub-1.5s initial load.</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-logo">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-info">
            <span class="stack-name">Supabase + Prisma</span>
            <span class="stack-desc"
              >PostgreSQL with Row-Level Security for PDF storage. Prisma for
              strict type-checked ORM queries.</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card stack-card-highlight">
          <div class="stack-logo">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96-.46 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4.44-1.14z"/><path d="M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.96-.46 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 0 .34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-4.44-1.14z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-info">
            <span class="stack-name">n8n — The Brain</span>
            <span class="stack-desc"
              >Central orchestrator. Handles PDF parsing, AI agent routing,
              Calendar API, quiz generation, and all gamification logic via
              visual workflows.</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-logo">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2"/><path d="M20 14h2"/><path d="M15 13v2"/><path d="M9 13v2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-info">
            <span class="stack-name">OpenAI / Gemini</span>
            <span class="stack-desc"
              >Semantic chunking and dynamic quiz generation. Catch nodes handle
              hallucinations and rate limits gracefully.</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

<style>
/* ── STACK ── */
  .stack-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stack-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .stack-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.4s,
      transform 0.4s,
      border-color 0.3s;
  }

  .stack-card.revealed {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .stack-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.3);
  }

  .stack-card-highlight {
    border-color: rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.3);
    background: rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.04);
  }

  .stack-logo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.15);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--purple-light);
  }

  .stack-name {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .stack-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
